<title>USA: Cirasella joins Lehman Brothers muni department.</title>
<headline>Cirasella joins Lehman Brothers muni department.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Cambridge Partners LLC managing director Mike Cirasella has joined Lehman Brothers' municipal department, a Lehman spokesman said Thursday.</p>
<p>Further details of the hire were not immediately available, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>Cirasella worked in Cambridge's underwriting department for about a year before leaving in September, a source at Cambridge said in September.</p>
<p>--Kathie O'Donnell, 212-859-1655</p>
